[00:34.52]Come share in the work of our Master;
[00:40.30]Respond to his call and obey.
[00:45.85]He offers to help and to guide you;
[00:51.76]His teaching will show you the way.
[00:57.13]The seed of the truth has power to grow
[01:03.20]In hearts that are honest and true.
[01:09.11]So give of your best as you faithfully share
[01:14.70]In the work you’ve been given to do.
[01:29.30]How much of your work is successful
[01:35.12]May often depend much on you.
